 "trade": "entry at the next M15 bar open (long ask / short bid); stop 1.5 x Wilder ATR14 of mid M15 = 1R; breakeven after +1R (one-bar latency), 3R target, exit at the next open after an opposite M15 supertrend flip (ATR10, mult 3, mid), time exit after 12 bars; label = net R > 0 after bid/ask",
 "decision": "score at the close of a completed M15 bar i (bars <= i only); mid = (bid + ask) / 2 per OHLC field",
 "features": {
  "order": [
   "spr",
   "h_s1",
   "h_c1",
